Identified data model
Registered business
- businessName
- tradeName
- businessType
- category
- pan
- cin
- yearEstablished
- website
Registered address
- address
- city
- state
- pincode
- country
Contacts and delivery location
- Primary contact: name, role, phone, email
- Alternate contact: name, role, phone, email
- Warehouse: address, contact number, operating hours
Verification
- Trust score
- Document ID
- Document type
- Document number
- Status
- Submission date
- Expiry date
- Review note
- Created/updated timestamps
Document types shown by the UI:
- GST Registration Certificate
- Business PAN Card
- Director / Authorized Signatory KYC
- End-Use Declaration (UCO)
Bank-account verification is the fifth verification-progress item.
Bank accounts
- Account holder name
- Bank name
- Account type
- Account number
- IFSC
- Branch
- Verification status
- Primary-account flag
The API will never return a full account number—only a masked value and last four digits.
Preferences and account security
Notification preferences:
- Order status updates
- Payment alerts
- Pickup/delivery reminders
- Price-drop alerts
- Weekly procurement report
- Marketing emails
Security preferences:
- Two-factor authentication
- Login activity alerts
- Automatic session timeout
Separate action payloads are required for password changes, account deactivation, and deletion.
REST API contract
All responses use { "data": ... }. Errors use { "error": ... }.
Method	Endpoint	Purpose
GET	/api/v1/buyer/profile	Read registered business and address
PUT	/api/v1/buyer/profile	Replace registered business and address
GET	/api/v1/buyer/profile/contact	Read contacts and warehouse
PUT	/api/v1/buyer/profile/contact	Replace contacts and warehouse
GET	/api/v1/buyer/profile/verification	Read trust score, progress, and documents
POST	/api/v1/buyer/profile/verification/documents	Upload a verification document
PUT	/api/v1/buyer/profile/verification/documents/{id}	Re-upload/update document metadata
GET	/api/v1/buyer/profile/verification/documents/{id}/download	Obtain authorized document download
GET	/api/v1/buyer/profile/bank-accounts	List linked accounts
POST	/api/v1/buyer/profile/bank-accounts	Add and initiate account verification
PATCH	/api/v1/buyer/profile/bank-accounts/{id}/primary	Make an account primary
DELETE	/api/v1/buyer/profile/bank-accounts/{id}	Remove an account
GET	/api/v1/buyer/profile/settings	Read preferences
PUT	/api/v1/buyer/profile/settings	Replace preferences
PUT	/api/v1/buyer/profile/password	Change password
POST	/api/v1/buyer/profile/deactivate	Temporarily deactivate account
DELETE	/api/v1/buyer/profile/account	Permanently delete account


Successful updates return 200; bank/document creation returns 201; successful deletion returns 204.
